/uk/">http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/2.0/uk/</ext-link>) which permits unrestricted non-commercial use, distribution, and reproduction in any medium, provided the original work is properly cited.</license-p></license></permissions></article-meta></front><body><p><bold>Erin M. Hulbert, Luc J. Smink, Ellen C. Adlem, James E. Allen, David B. Burdick, Oliver S. Burren, Christopher C. Cavnor, Geoffrey E. Dolman, Daisy Flamez, Karen F. Friery, Barry C. Healy, Sarah A. Killcoyne, Burak Kutlu, Helen Schuilenburg, Neil M. Walker, Josyf Mychaleckyj, Decio L. Eizirik, Linda S. Wicker, John A. Todd and Nathan Goodman</bold></p><p><italic>Nucleic Acids Res</italic>. (2007) <bold>35</bold>, <related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" id="d34e58" vol="35" page="D742" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="17169983" ext-link-type="pubmed">D742&#x02013;D746</related-article>.</p><p>The authors wish to apologize for the omission of an author from this article. Victor Cassen was one of the main developers in the project and should be rightfully credited for the work he has carried out. The correct author list should read as follows:</p><p>Erin M. Hulbert, Luc J. Smink, Ellen C. Adlem, James E. Allen, David B. Burdick, Oliver S. Burren, Victor M. Cassen, Christopher C. Cavnor, Geoffrey E. Dolman, Daisy Flamez, Karen F. Friery, Barry C. Healy, Sarah A. Killcoyne, Burak Kutlu, Helen Schuilenburg, Neil M. Walker, Josyf Mychaleckyj, Decio L. Eizirik, Linda S. Wicker, John A. Todd and Nathan Goodman</p></body></article>